ay to treat a character  who's not only grappling with grief but  also confronting her burgeoning  sexuality and feelings of social  isolation who could hopefully still find  a path to dealing with all that  Entwistle has also said that while the  comic is a story about mental illness  and essentially suicide what he wanted  to do with the show was build out the  back story of how Sid got to that point  and take all the elements of a journey  of somebody being confused by lots of  different things in their life and make  a different type of genre show so did  the ending of I am NOT okay with this  blow your mind and who do you think the  mystery figure is leave your thoughts  and theories in the comments below if  you enjoyed this than a thumbs up and a  share a hugely appreciated tapleft for  my latest Netflix videos on lock and key  stranger things and chilling adventures  of Sabrina what a pride for another  video you're sure to like thanks for  watching and see you next time  yippee-ki-yay movie lovers
 

